<StreetScene locale={locale} state="clean" />    {/* 同一個路口：電動機車 */}
<SceneCompare locale={locale} />                 {/* 兩者切換，不需要 JavaScript */}`}>
      <Fragment slot="note">
        <p>{L('招牌插畫：等紅燈的那一刻。一大群機車在停止線後怠速，行人從車陣前走過；紅圈標出每個人的口鼻高度，嬰兒與小學生在最濃的那一層。倒數在跑、霧層慢慢變厚；clean 狀態是同一個路口、同一個紅燈，只是沒有排氣管。窄螢幕自動換成精簡構圖。', 'The signature illustration: the red-light moment. A pack of scooters idles behind the stop line while people cross in front of it; a ring marks where each person breathes, with the baby and the schoolchild inside the densest layer. The countdown runs and the haze slowly thickens; the clean state is the same crossing and the same red light without tailpipes. Narrow containers switch to a compact composition automatically.')}</p>
