<Haze density={0.8} kind="fumes" />   {/* 放在 position: relative 的容器底部 */}
<Chapter haze={0.8} … />             {/* 或讓 Chapter 處理 */}`}>
      <Fragment slot="note">
        <p>{L('空氣有三種畫法，對應「聞得到」與「聞不到」：暖色波浪帶是聞得到的油氣（主角）；空心圓圈是無色無味的一氧化碳；針尖細點是看不到的超細微粒，飄得最高。機車在粉塵裡占比小、在氣體裡占比大，所以畫面以氣體為主，不畫黑煙。', 'Air is drawn three ways, for what you can and cannot smell: warm wavy ribbons are the fumes you smell (the lead); hollow rings are carbon monoxide, colourless and odourless; pin-point stipple is the ultrafine particles you cannot see, drifting highest. Scooters are a small share of dust and a large share of the gases, so the pictures lead with gases and never show black smoke.')}</p>
