        </ul>
        <h4>{L('線條粗細', 'Line weights')}</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>{L('人物四肢是圓頭粗線：成人腿 11、手臂 8.5、軀幹 23；孩童等比縮小。', 'Limbs are round-capped strokes: adult legs 11, arms 8.5, torso 23; children scaled down in proportion.')}</li>
          <li>{L('建築與背景用 1.5 的細線（.a-line）加淡色塊面（.a-plane），永遠比前景淡。', 'Architecture and background use 1.5 hairlines (.a-line) over pale planes (.a-plane), always lighter than the foreground.')}</li>
          <li>{L('量測線與尺規用 1.5（.a-rule）；指向口鼻的線是圓點虛線。', 'Measurement lines and the ruler are 1.5 (.a-rule); lines to a mouth are dotted.')}</li>
        </ul>
        <h4>{L('用色', 'Palette')}</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>{L('人與車只有墨色（--art-ink）與更深的輪胎、座墊（--art-deep）。深色主題下反過來變成淺色剪影。', 'People and vehicles use ink (--art-ink) with deeper tyres and seats (--art-deep) and nothing else. In the dark theme they invert to light silhouettes.')}</li>
          <li>{L('每個物件最多一個重點色：燃油車是排氣口的赭黃，電動車是綠色燈條與輪轂，小學生是黃帽子，尾燈與紅燈是紅色。', 'One accent per object at most: the ochre tailpipe on a gasoline scooter, the green light strip and hub on an electric one, the schoolchild’s yellow cap, red for tail lamps and the red signal.')}</li>
          <li>{L('暖色只屬於廢氣。不要把赭黃用在建築、衣服或裝飾上。', 'Warm colour belongs to exhaust alone. Never use ochre on buildings, clothes or decoration.')}</li>
        </ul>
        <h4>{L('怎麼畫空氣', 'How air is drawn')}</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>{L('聞得到的油氣：一層由下往上變淡的底色，加上水平波浪帶，愈近地面愈粗、愈密（指數遞減，尺度高約 40 公分）。它畫在人物「前面」，所以腿和輪子會被遮住一些。', 'Fumes you can smell: a wash that fades upward plus horizontal wavy ribbons, thicker and denser toward the ground (exponential, scale height about 40 cm). It is drawn in front of the figures, so legs and wheels are partly veiled.')}</li>
          <li>{L('聞不到的一氧化碳：空心圓圈，冷色，分布比油氣高。', 'Carbon monoxide you cannot smell: hollow rings in a cool colour, spread higher than the fumes.')}</li>
          <li>{L('看不到的超細微粒：針尖大小的點，分布最高。', 'Ultrafine particles you cannot see: pin-point dots, spread highest.')}</li>
          <li>{L('不畫黑煙、不畫骷髏、不畫口罩。讓人不安的是高度，不是誇張。', 'No black smoke, no skulls, no masks. What unsettles is the height, not exaggeration.')}</li>
        </ul>
        <h4>{L('怎麼畫人', 'How people are drawn')}</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>{L('像行人號誌裡的人：圓頭、膠囊身體、圓頭四肢，沒有五官、膚色、性別特徵。', 'Like the figure in a pedestrian signal: round head, capsule torso, round-capped limbs; no facial features, skin colour or gender markers.')}</li>
          <li>{L('用身高與道具區分：小學生（黃帽、書包）、推嬰兒車的家長、拄拐杖微駝的長者、戴安全帽的騎士。', 'Tell them apart by height and props: the schoolchild (yellow cap, school bag), the parent with a stroller, the elder slightly stooped with a cane, the rider in a helmet.')}</li>
          <li>{L('騎士和行人畫法完全相同：他們不是反派，他們吸到的最多。', 'Riders are drawn exactly like pedestrians: they are not the villains, and they breathe the most.')}</li>
          <li>{L('每個人的口鼻用一個圓圈標出（breath()）；紅色表示有廢氣，綠色表示乾淨。', 'Each mouth is marked with a ring (breath()); red where there is exhaust, green where the air is clean.')}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </Block>
  </Section>
</Base>

